<title>ALBANIA: Albania Dec 1996 inflation rises to 17.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Albania Dec 1996 inflation rises to 17.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicator detail on Wednesday.</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION	   DEC 96    NOV 96   DEC 95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)    +0.7	-0.5     +0.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change		+17.4     +17.4     +6.01</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	 144.15    143.19   122.78</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
